From d5db278c6d5698c387c5cc303b818fd287211e95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mattryznar <ryznarmat@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:05:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Iskra: AMD SVM bring-up self-test (hypervisor step 1)

At boot on the BSP, enable SVM, run a real-mode guest (mov ax,0x1234; hlt)
with VMRUN and check for a HLT exit with AX=0x1234. Behind the
iskra_svm_selftest feature (on by default in this patched kernel only).
